    "enUS": {
      "description": "You've shown yourself a dependable {class}, {name}.  Dependable, and not afraid to get your hands dirty, eh?\n\nI have a friend, Milly Osworth, who's in some trouble.  She's over with her wagon on the other side of the abbey, near the stable.  I'm sure she could use a pair of hands like yours.",
      "summary": "Speak with Milly Osworth.",
      "title": "Milly Osworth",
